/E (Historically, technology and CS have been homogeneous, male-dominated fields. We recognize that increased diversity in tech will cultivate innovation, challenge the status quo, and better serve the needs of society. Therefore, our organization's goal is to create a diverse community that supports the advancement of women and gender diverse students in computer science, in academia, industry, and beyond. )
