133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (Each year, WiCS, in collaboration with the Columbia Computer Science department, sends several Columbia students to attend the Grace Hopper Celebration, the world's largest conference of women in technology, free of charge. Students get the opportunity to hear from inspiring keynote speakers that cover a range of topics, from AI to entrepreneurship. There are also numerous presentations and workshops about the latest research in computer science, mentorship opportunities, career fairs for students, and interviews for summer internships and jobs. However, the cost of attendance is prohibitive for many students.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (Last year, with help from our corporate sponsors, we were able to send 10 students GHC 2025, free of charge.  We hope to send even more passionate, talented, and ambitious members of the Columbia community to the conference this coming fall!)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
