<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (DivHacks is Columbia's premier student-run diversity hackathon. Over seven years of hosting the event, we have created an empowering and inspirational space for marginalized communities from all over the tristate area to create the very technologies they want to see in the world.  Our attendees have created a variety of incredible and creative hacks centered around themes such as Education, Diversity, Green Tech, and most recently, Patient Safety.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
