146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (The WiCS annual networking dinner, NetWiCS, is Columbia's largest all-female computer science event. It is held every spring semester. NetWiCS 2025 drew in 100+ attendees, including students, professors, alumni, engineers, and recruiters. For many students, NetWiCS is their first opportunity to talk face-to-face in a relaxed environment with female and non-binary engineers from some of the most noteworthy companies in technology. It's an unparalleled opportunity for many female/non-binary students to decide whether they want to enter the field, to meet potential mentors, and to jump-start their own careers. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
